VLUN — smart-contract security reasoning dataset
Copyright (c) 2026 the VLUN authors.

This repository is licensed under a split licence. Read all five parts. They
do not cover the same material, and they do not cover everything in the
repository.

================================================================================
0. WHAT IS LICENSED HERE AT ALL
================================================================================

This licence covers ONLY the material the VLUN authors authored, and ONLY the
part of that material that is released.

The released set is enumerated, path by path, in `RELEASE_MANIFEST.json`.
**A path that is not listed there with a released rights status is not
licensed here**, whatever else this file says. Each listed path carries one
rights status:

  project_own                    the authors' own work
  metadata_only                  factual metadata the authors recorded
  attribution_required           released, and a reuser must attribute the
                                 original author
  withheld_third_party_no_redistribution_rights
                                 copied third-party material; not released
  internal_research_artefact_not_cleared
                                 the authors' own working artefact whose rights
                                 position is not established; not released

`RELEASE_MANIFEST.json` is generated by `scripts/build_release_manifest.py`
and is enforced by `scripts/check_rights_consistency.py`, which fails the
build when a path's declared status contradicts its content, when a released
path is missing, when a path in the tree is absent from the manifest, or when
a shipped rights statement contradicts the manifest.

The repository also contains internal research artefacts: the evidence
layers, the run logs, the benchmark and training views, and the parts of the
analysis reports that quote upstream text. They are retained for research.
**They are not licensed here and they are not cleared for redistribution.**

